{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0204_1000_p", "source_sha256": "70bba3390607202f7234ec9a705ffde77233dc0945a9d511fa2c8babd0ef67b9", "ja": "歩、衣装はどうだ？\n何か問題があるなら……。", "zh": "步，服装怎么样？\n要是有什么问题的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0204_1001_034ayu", "source_sha256": "4cd34dd24c0084c9c9286223568eab48bfe25f97a3d1bba38b480fa6b45f81be", "ja": "{$P$}！　新しい衣装、ありがとう！\nこれ、サイコーに気に入ったよっ！", "zh": "{$P$}！新的服装，谢谢你！\n我超级中意这套的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0204_1002_034ayu", "source_sha256": "020fca893385533eba603616f716e88ed70b3fbe68afcbb7688e568b4f4628f2", "ja": "すっごくカワイイし、踊りやすいんだ！\nほら、見てよ！", "zh": "超级可爱，而且跳起来也很方便！  \n你看，快看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0204_1003_p", "source_sha256": "d9c4b86e8c28b8925637809447fcf34d41904c53624a77e143a3cc864a2e7fc5", "ja": "ははっ、問題ないみたいだな。\nうん……キマってるな！　歩、カワイイぞ！", "zh": "哈哈，看来没问题啊。\n嗯……很合适！步，你真可爱！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0204_1004_034ayu", "source_sha256": "ee4116e6a8f6bf57f03c673ae85577d5329900abd6ffe1e04e57cd6b05e6f7fe", "ja": "か、カワイイ！？　いきなりやめてよー！\nそういうの、あんまり慣れてないんだからさ……。", "zh": "可、可爱！？突然别这样啊——！\n我可不太习惯这种事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0204_1005_034ayu", "source_sha256": "dcea5dea2eef7e16f408e4fd986dbe24afe23690f852daec372708c08e104201", "ja": "ううー、なんかすごいドキドキしてきた……。\nね、ねえ！　これ着て、レッスン行ってもいい？", "zh": "呜呜——总觉得心跳得好厉害……  \n那、那个！我穿着这个去上课，可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0204_1006_p", "source_sha256": "565c2d2903c9ee1dd44d9f28d3cf43d71970b39289c603ecd587d2ff6d31fd94", "ja": "どうしたんだ、急に？　試着用に、簡単に仮縫い\nしてる箇所があるから、レッスンは少し難しいかな。", "zh": "怎么了，突然这样？因为有些地方只是为了试穿而简单地假缝了一下，去上课可能会有点困难。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0204_1007_034ayu", "source_sha256": "6aeaa78c28e9358a18ec9e656cf00657e57817eb42a34dbe4f7d7e52ba2a0368", "ja": "そ、そうだよね……。でも……うう、\nカワイさを意識すると、アタシ、どうも調子が……。", "zh": "对、对啊……不过……呜呜，一想到可爱，我就总觉得状态不太对……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0204_1008_034ayu", "source_sha256": "13bfc637def173c490cb05fa247af1efaae269c6a02b23f89502d0df0211bdce", "ja": "この衣装、カワイすぎるんだよなぁ……。\nスカートだって、すごく短いし……。", "zh": "这套服装也太可爱了吧……  \n连裙子都特别短……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0204_1009_p", "source_sha256": "14a49fd6d97c7325c40dd813b6ca1537d6c7c0f999a181c253b187eca410708e", "ja": "テニスウェアをモチーフにした衣装だけど、\nそもそもテニスウェアはカワイイからなぁ。", "zh": "虽然这套服装是以网球服为主题的，但网球服本来就很可爱啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0204_1010_034ayu", "source_sha256": "40e973f9667c8921285d5c6da43133ef40a90c7b3801611705b747dc92dc26de", "ja": "そうだね。カワイイものをもっとカワイくした\nんだから、めちゃめちゃカワイくなる……。", "zh": "是啊。既然是把可爱的东西变得更加可爱，那肯定会变得超级可爱……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0204_1011_034ayu", "source_sha256": "193bae58266a66a5f4c0e3e23cd7703f2beb8697f35f7a85b091948ca0d53b4b", "ja": "でもさ、どうしてテニスウェアのスコートって、\nこんなに短いんだろう？", "zh": "不过话说回来，为什么网球服的裙裤会这么短呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0204_1012_p", "source_sha256": "46361ae0e3b7417ce985778be7416608836f51dee055d6cb79e032e1ef717de6", "ja": "それは……やっぱり、動きやすいからじゃないか？\nスポーツウェアなんだし。", "zh": "那是……因为穿起来果然更方便活动吧？\n毕竟是运动服嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0204_1013_034ayu", "source_sha256": "ada26fdb8f818038fac750b82638f69ad48f90ffb9ac46b79d82ee2bdd037b57", "ja": "動きやすさかぁ。\nそれなら、ハーフパンツとかでもいいんじゃない？", "zh": "是为了方便活动啊。\n那样的话，穿五分裤之类的也可以吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0204_1014_p", "source_sha256": "b63a5b2f25f37bb07afd5c62168c78e73f1be9e9ef78651111b6728d70bbf46b", "ja": "そこはやっぱり「魅せる」って\n側面があるんじゃないか？　プロなわけだし。", "zh": "毕竟也有“展现魅力”的一面吧？我们可是专业的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0204_1015_034ayu", "source_sha256": "e8dac8b6eb0998d2344e7ad17b95a0ee62e29dd2523e8be4d5989f0e8873737b", "ja": "魅せる、ね……。アタシたちも魅せるって意味では\nプロなわけだし、恥ずかしがってちゃダメだよね！", "zh": "展现魅力啊……既然我们在展现魅力这方面也是专业的，就不能再害羞了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0204_1016_034ayu", "source_sha256": "fbe8a95d6b3d259e3d12ed4a5b9e59d937d10cf4cd6bb11dd8c04ce286b31c39", "ja": "サンキュー、{$P$}！\nアタシ、大事なことを忘れるところだったよ！", "zh": "谢啦，{$P$}！\n我差点把重要的事忘了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0204_1017_p", "source_sha256": "919b79f88a2e1bccaebfb7c9118fd990295b55b269c91e55695e62052c76019c", "ja": "どういたしまして。\nいつもの調子に戻ったみたいで安心したよ。", "zh": "不客气。\n你看起来已经恢复平时的状态了，我就放心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0204_1018_034ayu", "source_sha256": "4bd6c2af6849692e3c453e2e04ca764cab8a30d2681cf6eb17053a560a616adc", "ja": "へへっ、心配かけてごめん。\nでも、もう平気っ！", "zh": "嘿嘿，让你担心了，对不起。\n不过，我已经没事啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_034ayu0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_034ayu0204_1019_034ayu", "source_sha256": "dedd890a2c27aeb7d09ce5ffc1e8cd1edac67e6bd471c462b3b2e1cebfb81bed", "ja": "{$P$}、見ててよ！\nこの衣装で、バッチリファンを魅了してみせるから♪", "zh": "{$P$}，看好了！\n我会穿着这身服装，彻底把粉丝们迷住给你看♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
